Package: standards-sync
Version: @VERSION@-1
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Sebastien Rousseau <sebastian.rousseau@gmail.com>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.9), git
Section: devel
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/sebastienrousseau/standards
Description: keep the code standards in sync without losing edits
 standards-sync copies five canonical standards files to the workspace
 root and the dotfiles copies, keeps any copy edited in place instead of
 overwriting it, and reports the drift with diffs.
